                    text="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; STATE OF CALIFORNIA - DEPARTMENT OF PERSONNEL ADMINISTRATION&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;b>&amp;nbsp; DENTAL PLAN ENROLLMENT AUTHORIZATION&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&amp;nbsp; STD. 692 (REV. 2-2008)&amp;nbsp; (REVERSE)&lt;/p>&#xa;"
